"Mortals level and Develop their abilities faster than Questors."
"Questors plateau: their levels rise but their builds barely change."
"Questor wars grant no levels, so Questors climb levels only by braving the wilds."
"Clearing a blight grants huge levels; a small band that cleared one all passed level 1000."
"Later, Nathan leveled by slaughtering Giantsrest mages."
"Later, Nathan's classes were Void of Magic 517 and Spellslayer 379."
"Years later, Sarya was level 4570, up 44 levels since the last Ending."
"Years later, Stella was level 729 yet could fight mages five times her level with her Insights."
"Years later, killing three patrol soldiers lifted Nathan's classes from 834 to 839 and 572 to 585."
"Killing the Questor Sussu lifted them from 839 to 872 and from 619 to 644."
"Nathan's End of Magic Stamina maximum rose exactly 100 per level (84400 at 834, 134700 at 1337)."
"His Spellslayer and Death of Legends Focus maximum rose by 10 per level above 585."
"In late duels at the great Conclave Nathan's levels jumped by 14 and 24, then 42 and 30."
"Nathan ended at End of Magic level 1337 and Death of Legends level 951."
